# Wrrapd brand icon (canonical)

**Always use** the centered, grounded red-W + gold-bow mark — **never** the older floating-W icon.

| Asset | Path |
|---|---|
| Source of truth | `wordpress/icons/favicon/icon-focus-512.png` |
| Derived sizes | `wordpress/icons/favicon/icon-{16,32,48,64,96,128,180,192,256,512,1024,2048}.png`, `favicon.ico` |
| Live MU path | `wp-content/mu-plugins/icons/favicon/` |
| Media Library (Site Icon) | `wrrapd-bow-favicon-180.png` (from focus pack) |

## Rules for agents

- When adding favicons, PWA icons, apple-touch icons, admin/chrome marks, or any square Wrrapd “app icon,” use the **focus** pack above.
- Do **not** resurrect or link the pre-focus floating-W PNGs.
- Full wordmark (`Wrrapd_f-Logo-800-x-458-px.png`) is separate — use for header/footer **word** branding only; square icon contexts use the focus W.
- After regenerating sizes from `icon-focus-512.png`, redeploy `wordpress/icons/favicon/` to SiteGround `mu-plugins/icons/favicon/`.
